('Resume a saved session','resume-chooser','A valid matching private checkpoint is available on an opted-in boot. Grey chooses **Resume saved session** or **Start a new session**; Blue explicitly selects. Only Resume restores the saved live mode. Release both buttons so a boot-held key is not treated as a play.'),
('Saved scores cannot be read','read-retry','The initial public read failed, so saved totals are unavailable rather than assumed zero. Grey chooses **Retry reading saved scores** or **Start fresh without saving**; Blue confirms. The fresh RAM path leaves both journals untouched and labels UNSAVED.'),
('Protected save cannot be acknowledged','save-retry','SAVE RETRY holds the new answer/feedback behind the public acknowledgment gate. Grey selects **Retry saving session** or **Start fresh without saving**; Blue confirms. Fresh RAM discards the pending session, keeps only known acknowledged totals/preferences and disables resume/writes for that boot.'),
('Fresh RAM-only presentation','unsaved','UNSAVED remains visible during the fresh independent session. Resume cannot be reenabled for that RAM-only boot. No journal writes/deletes occur; after a later reboot the last valid durable checkpoint may still be offered.'),
